        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "河野權大參事留守官屆書ニ大參事ト爲ス恐クハ誤ナラン小藩ハ大參事三名ヲ置クヲ得ス"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "河野権大参事、留守官届書に大参事とす。恐らくは誤りならん。小藩は大参事三名を置くを得ず。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Editorial note: \"Kōno, gon-daisanji — the report submitted to the Rusukan (Regency Office) enters him as daisanji. This is probably an error: a small domain may not appoint three daisanji.\""
      },
      {
